cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Factorial ablation of imbalance corrections across five domains"
abstract: >-
  Code, fixed data splits and results for a 2x2x2 factorial ablation of three
  class-imbalance corrections (SMOTETomek resampling, cost-sensitive class weights
  and decision-threshold tuning), plus weights recomputed after resampling, with
  seven classifiers under nested 5x2 cross-validation on five datasets (Oil Spill,
  SMS Spam, CIC-IDS2017, APS Failure at Scania Trucks, Credit Card Fraud).
authors:
